<h1 data-copy-en="Stats, Skills &amp; Proficiencies" data-copy-zh="属性、技能与起始专长">Stats, Skills &amp; Proficiencies</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Choose a learning route, compare starting builds and find every current skill, lesson cost and source." data-copy-zh="比较起始培养方向，了解属性与资源，并查找当前全部技能、课程费用及学习来源。">Choose a learning route, compare starting builds and find every current skill, lesson cost and source.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
