h><td data-label="Purpose">Enhance weapons or items</td><td data-label="Current sources">Ordinary random learning; <a href="character-aziza.html">Aziza</a></td><td data-label="Gonzo book base-stat filter">Mystic ≥16</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Energy Drain</th><td data-label="Purpose">Steal enemy vitality</td><td data-label="Current sources">Ordinary random learning; <a href="character-melanthe.html">Melanthe</a></td><td data-label="Gonzo book base-stat filter">Mystic ≥24</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Healing Touch</th><td data-label="Purpose">Restore health to self or others</td><td data-label="Current sources">Ordinary random learning; <a href="character-sashina.html">Sashina</a>; Monk's Temple Training Hall</td><td data-label="Gonzo book base-stat filter">Mystic ≥15</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Illusion Weaving</th><td data-label="Purpose">Create false images</td><td data-label="Current sources">Ordinary random learning; <a href="character-sashina.html">Sashina</a></td><td data-label="Gonzo book base-stat filter">Mystic ≥20</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Inner Peace</th><td data-label="Purpose">Reduces negative Calm adjustments.</td><td data-label="Current sources">Ordinary random learning; Monk's Temple Training Hall</td><td data-label="Gonzo book base-stat filter">Mystic ≥30</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Light Magic</th><td data-label="Purpose">Harness the power of holy light and divine energy</td><td data-label="Current sources">Ordinary random learning; Seraph's Sanctuary; Dedicated Crystal lesson:3 Crystals, zero minutes</td><td data-label="Gonzo book base-stat filter">Mystic ≥30</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Mana Channeling</th><td data-label="Purpose">Enhanced magical energy</td><td data-label="Current sources">Ordinary random learning; <a href="character-aziza.html">Aziza</a></td><td data-label="Gonzo book base-stat filter">Mystic ≥18</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Master Wizard</th><td data-label="Purpose">Ultimate magical power and arcane supremacy</td><td data-label="Current sources">Ordinary random learning; <a href="character-gandon.html">Gandon</a></td><td data-label="Gonzo book base-stat filter">Mystic ≥60</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Nature's Embrace</th><td data-label="Purpose">Defending in combat restores 4-10% of maximum energy</td><td data-label="Current sources"><a href="character-audrey.html">Audrey</a></td><td data-label="Gonzo book base-stat filter">— (specific source)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Pixie's Promise</th><td data-label="Purpose">Once each day, restores full Health when ordinary combat would defeat you.</td><td data-label="Current sources"><a href="character-pixie.html">Pixie</a></td><td data-label="Gonzo book base-stat filter">— (specific source)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Precognition</th><td data-label="Purpose">A separate 10% incoming-attack dodge check; see Combat for stacking.</td><td data-label="Current sources">Story Beat 39</td><td data-label="Gonzo book base-stat filter">— (specific source)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Protective Ward</th><td data-label="Purpose">Magical damage reduction</td><td data-label="Current sources">Ordinary random learning; <a href="character-blinky.html">Blinky</a></td><td data-label="Gonzo book base-stat filter">Mystic ≥14</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Ritual Mastery</th><td data-label="Purpose">Complex magical ceremonies</td><td data-label="Current sources">Ordinary random learning; <a href="character-sabbath.html">Sabbath</a></td><td data-label="Gonzo book base-stat filter">Mystic ≥22</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Sacred Mending</th><td data-label="Purpose">A 30% chance to double the effectiveness of healing magic</td><td data-label="Current sources"><a href="character-amelia.html">Amelia</a></td><td data-label="Gonzo book base-stat filter">— (specific source)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Sashina's Gift</th><td data-label="Purpose">An additional fire/ice magic proc; see Combat for its separate rules.</td><td data-label="Current sources"><a href="character-sashina.html">Sashina</a></td><td data-label="Gonzo book base-stat filter">— (specific source)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Soul Sight</th><td data-label="Purpose">Reveals NPC alignment.</td><td data-label="Current sources"><a href="character-azariel.html">Azariel</a></td><td data-label="Gonzo book base-stat filter">— (specific source)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Spirit Communication</th><td data-label="Purpose">Talk to supernatural entities</td><td data-label="Current sources">Ordinary random learning; <a href="character-zodiac.html">Zodiac</a></td><td data-label="Gonzo book base-stat filter">Mystic ≥18</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Telekinesis</th><td data-label="Purpose">Move objects with mind</td><td data-label="Current sources">Ordinary random learning; <a href="character-sashina.html">Sashina</a></td><td data-label="Gonzo book base-stat filter">Mystic ≥25</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Tempest Strike</th><td data-label="Purpose">Imbues Stormslash with lightning energy, granting a chance to chain lightning across the enemy</td><td data-label="Current sources"><a href="character-sylwithe.html">Sylwithe</a></td><td data-label="Gonzo book base-stat filter">— (specific source)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Transmutation</th><td data-label="Purpose">Special alchemical and encounter options.</td><td data-label="Current sources"><a href="character-sashina.html">Sashina</a></td><td data-label="Gonzo book base-stat filter">— (specific source)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Vampirism</th><td data-label="Purpose">Improves relevant Vampire Fangs and Grimoire combat procs.</td><td data-label="Current sources"><a href="character-carmilla.html">Lady Carmilla</a></td><td data-label="Gonzo book base-stat filter">— (specific source)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Wizardry</th><td data-label="Purpose">Advanced magical mastery and spellcasting abilities</td><td data-label="Current sources">Ordinary random learning; <a href="character-gandon.html">Gandon</a></td><td data-label="Gonzo book base-stat filter">Mystic ≥40</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
