="Current sources">Ordinary random learning; <a href="character-vixen.html">Vixen</a></td><td data-label="Gonzo book base-stat filter">Charm ≥18</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Empathy</th><td data-label="Purpose">Understand emotional states</td><td data-label="Current sources">Ordinary random learning; <a href="character-azariel.html">Azariel</a></td><td data-label="Gonzo book base-stat filter">Perception ≥15</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Fashion</th><td data-label="Purpose">Master sense of style and appearance across all eras</td><td data-label="Current sources">Tailor Shop</td><td data-label="Gonzo book base-stat filter">— (specific source)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Information Brokering</th><td data-label="Purpose">Trade in secrets</td><td data-label="Current sources">Ordinary random learning; <a href="character-cressida.html">Cressida</a>; <a href="character-vixen.html">Vixen</a>; Cognitive Optimization Academy</td><td data-label="Gonzo book base-stat filter">Intelligence ≥18</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Leadership</th><td data-label="Purpose">Unlocks the Leadership attribute used by TD.</td><td data-label="Current sources">Ordinary random learning; <a href="character-ghost.html">Ghost</a></td><td data-label="Gonzo book base-stat filter">Charm ≥22</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Negotiation</th><td data-label="Purpose">Favorable deal-making</td><td data-label="Current sources">Ordinary random learning; <a href="character-jinx.html">Jinx</a></td><td data-label="Gonzo book base-stat filter">Intelligence ≥16</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Networking</th><td data-label="Purpose">Build useful connections</td><td data-label="Current sources">Ordinary random learning; <a href="character-glitch.html">Glitch</a></td><td data-label="Gonzo book base-stat filter">Charm ≥15</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Reading People</th><td data-label="Purpose">Understand motivations</td><td data-label="Current sources">Ordinary random learning; <a href="character-joey.html">Joey</a>; <a href="character-vixen.html">Vixen</a></td><td data-label="Gonzo book base-stat filter">Perception ≥18</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Reputation Management</th><td data-label="Purpose">Control public image</td><td data-label="Current sources">Ordinary random learning; <a href="character-vixen.html">Vixen</a>; Cognitive Optimization Academy</td><td data-label="Gonzo book base-stat filter">Charm ≥16</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Silver Tongue</th><td data-label="Purpose">Exceptional persuasion ability</td><td data-label="Current sources">Ordinary random learning; Bards Guild</td><td data-label="Gonzo book base-stat filter">Charm ≥20</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Tamer</th><td data-label="Purpose">Unlocks the Taming attribute used by capture and training.</td><td data-label="Current sources"><a href="character-raven.html">Raven</a></td><td data-label="Gonzo book base-stat filter">— (specific source)</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
