<section id="en-specific-sources"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Exclusive_skills"></span><h2>Specific sources and important conditions</h2><p>Twenty-seven skills are excluded from these two ordinary random methods. Obtain them through their listed teacher, location or Objective. If a skill has multiple normal sources, choose a route rather than paying to learn it repeatedly.</p><p>Fashion’s Tailor Shop lesson requires base Attractiveness 18,$300 and 180 minutes, with base drains 50 Energy and 40 Calm. That Attractiveness gate is currently enforced. Sensual Mastery remains obtainable through Crystals or another normal source; Gonzo’s base-stat filter does not select it.</p><p>Stormslash has a current route through Saber and also belongs to the ordinary random range. See <a href="game-systems-specialist-class.html">Specialist Classes</a> and <a href="game-systems-combat-system.html">Combat</a> for path bonuses, spell use and escape exceptions.</p></section>
